#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:1
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:3
msgid ""
"This is the first thing to do with a fresh clone of HybridInference. It "
"takes one local gateway through three stages:"
msgstr "刚 clone 下 HybridInference，第一件事就是走一遍本教程。整个过程在同一个本地网关上分三个阶段完成："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:6
msgid "prove the routing chain with a deterministic fake provider;"
msgstr "用一个固定回复的假 provider 跑通整条路由链路；"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:7
msgid ""
"continue the same running Compose project into the Web Console, Admin "
"Console, Postgres, accounts, API keys, and request history;"
msgstr "在这个正在运行的 Compose 项目上继续，加上 Web 控制台、管理控制台、Postgres、账号、API key 和请求历史；"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:9
msgid ""
"replace the fake provider with a local OpenAI-compatible vLLM, SGLang, or"
" Ollama server."
msgstr "把假 provider 换成本地的 OpenAI 兼容服务器——vLLM、SGLang 或 Ollama。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:12
msgid ""
"Each stage builds on the one before, so you see one request succeed "
"before adding the parts that have more ways to fail."
msgstr "每个阶段都在上一阶段的基础上继续，所以你会先看到一个请求跑通，再去加那些更容易出错的部分。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:15
msgid ""
"No provider account, host `.env`, GPU, SMTP service, or paid API key is "
"needed for the first two stages. CI runs the same commands on every "
"change that touches them."
msgstr ""
"前两个阶段不需要 provider 账号、主机上的 `.env`、GPU、SMTP 服务或付费 API key。只要有改动涉及这两个阶段，CI "
"都会把同样的命令跑一遍。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:19
msgid ""
"If you would rather run the gateway from a source checkout without "
"Docker, and against real models, see [Installation](installation.md) — "
"but come back here first if you have never seen this gateway serve a "
"request."
msgstr ""
"如果你想不用 "
"Docker、直接从源码运行网关并对接真实模型，见[安装](installation.md)。不过，要是还没见过这个网关处理请求，建议先把本教程走一遍。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:23
msgid "What you need"
msgstr "需要准备什么"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:25
msgid "Docker Engine 24+ with Compose v2. Check with `docker compose version`."
msgstr "Docker Engine 24+，带 Compose v2。用 `docker compose version` 确认。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:26
msgid ""
"A running Docker daemon. On macOS, start Docker Desktop or Colima; "
"`docker info` must succeed, and the directory you clone into must be one "
"Docker is allowed to share into containers."
msgstr ""
"Docker daemon 正在运行。macOS 上先启动 Docker Desktop 或 Colima；`docker info` "
"要能执行成功，clone 到的目录也必须是 Docker 允许共享给容器的目录。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:29
msgid ""
"Git, curl, GNU Make, and Python 3.10–3.13 (3.12 recommended). The smoke "
"clients use only the Python standard library, so there is no `pip "
"install` step."
msgstr ""
"Git、curl、GNU Make 和 Python 3.10–3.13（推荐 3.12）。smoke 客户端只用 Python 标准库，所以没有"
" `pip install` 这一步。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:32
msgid ""
"Several GB of free disk for the backend, frontend, Postgres image, and "
"local database volume."
msgstr "几 GB 空闲磁盘，用来放后端、前端和 Postgres 的镜像，以及本地数据库卷。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:34
msgid ""
"These loopback ports free: backend `18080`, frontend `13001`, and "
"Postgres `15432`. Only `18080` is used in Stage 1 — `make up` on this "
"overlay starts the backend with `--no-deps`, so the frontend and Postgres"
" stay stopped until Stage 2. See [Port already in use](#port-already-in-"
"use) to override them."
msgstr ""
"以下回环端口需要空闲：后端 `18080`、前端 `13001`、Postgres `15432`。阶段 1 只用到 `18080`：在这个 "
"overlay 上，`make up` 会带 `--no-deps` 启动后端，所以前端和 Postgres 要到阶段 2 "
"才会启动。要改用别的端口，见[端口已被占用](#port-already-in-use)。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:39
msgid ""
"Node.js is not required because the frontend is built in Docker. A GPU is"
" only needed if you continue to Stage 3 with a GPU-backed local server."
msgstr "不需要 Node.js，因为前端是在 Docker 里构建的。只有到阶段 3 要用带 GPU 的本地服务器时，才需要 GPU。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:42
msgid "Stage 1: prove the router works"
msgstr "阶段 1：确认路由能正常工作"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:44
msgid "Clone the repository and start the runnable distribution:"
msgstr "clone 仓库，启动这个可运行的发行版："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:53
msgid ""
"Two containers start: `example-provider`, a deterministic OpenAI-"
"compatible upstream, and `backend`, the HybridInference gateway. Postgres"
" and the frontend remain stopped; accounts and authentication are "
"disabled at this checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"这会启动两个容器：`example-provider` 是一个总是返回固定回复的 OpenAI 兼容上游，`backend` 是 "
"HybridInference 网关。Postgres 和前端仍然停着；在这个阶段，账号和鉴权都是关闭的。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:57
msgid "Run the automated check:"
msgstr "运行自动检查："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:67
msgid ""
"The smoke waits for startup and verifies `/health`, `/site-config`, "
"`/v1/models`, and a routed completion."
msgstr ""
"smoke 会等待启动完成，然后验证 `/health`、`/site-config`、`/v1/models` 以及一次经过路由的 "
"completion。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:70
msgid "Inspect the gateway yourself"
msgstr "自己动手检查网关"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:72
msgid "Check health:"
msgstr "查看健康状态："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:87
msgid "List models:"
msgstr "列出模型："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:93
msgid ""
"The response contains the public model id `example-chat`. Its registry "
"entry is in `distributions/example/config/models.yaml`, which the backend"
" finds through the distribution manifest "
"`distributions/example/distribution.yaml` — see "
"[Configuration](configuration.md) for how that resolution works."
msgstr ""
"响应里有对外的模型 id `example-chat`。它的注册表条目在 "
"`distributions/example/config/models.yaml`，后端通过发行版 manifest "
"`distributions/example/distribution.yaml` "
"找到这个文件——具体怎么查找，见[配置](configuration.md)。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:98
msgid ""
"The file is mounted into the container rather than built into the image, "
"so an edit only needs a backend restart. To try it, change the model's "
"`name` from `Runnable Example Chat` to `Reloaded Example Chat`, run `make"
" restart s=backend DISTRIBUTION=example`, and list the models again. "
"Change it back and restart once more before continuing."
msgstr ""
"这个文件是挂载进容器的，没有打进镜像，所以改完只需要重启后端。想试一下的话，把模型的 `name` 从 `Runnable Example "
"Chat` 改成 `Reloaded Example Chat`，运行 `make restart s=backend "
"DISTRIBUTION=example`，再列一次模型。继续之前把它改回来，再重启一次。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:104
msgid "Send a completion:"
msgstr "发送一次 completion："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:112
msgid "The assistant content is:"
msgstr "assistant 的内容是："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:118
msgid ""
"Only the bundled fake provider sends that reply, so seeing it means the "
"request went through the gateway's routing. Clients ask for `example-"
"chat`; the route translates that into the provider's own model name."
msgstr ""
"只有随附的假 provider 才会发这个回复，所以看到它，就说明请求确实走了网关的路由。客户端请求的是 `example-"
"chat`，路由再把它换成 provider 自己的模型名。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:122
msgid "Streaming uses the same endpoint:"
msgstr "流式用的是同一个端点："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:130
msgid ""
"The answer arrives as a series of `chat.completion.chunk` events and ends"
" with the line `data: [DONE]`."
msgstr "回答以一连串 `chat.completion.chunk` 事件的形式返回，最后以 `data: [DONE]` 这一行结束。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:133
msgid "To see the route the gateway just used, ask it:"
msgstr "想知道网关刚才走了哪条路由，直接问它："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:139
msgid ""
"This is an unauthenticated endpoint that reports each model's upstream "
"base URLs and weights. That is what you want on a laptop and not what you"
" want on a public host — see the warning in [Routing](routing.md#api-"
"endpoints)."
msgstr ""
"这个端点不需要鉴权，会返回每个模型的上游 base URL "
"和权重。在自己的笔记本上这正合适，放到公网主机上就不行了——见[路由](routing.md#api-endpoints)里的警告。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:143
msgid ""
"Do not run `make down` here. Stage 2 extends this same Compose project in"
" place."
msgstr "这里不要运行 `make down`。阶段 2 是在同一个 Compose 项目上原地扩展的。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:146
msgid "Stage 2: continue into the Web and Admin Consoles"
msgstr "阶段 2：接入 Web 控制台和管理控制台"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:148
msgid ""
"Add Postgres and the frontend, and recreate the backend with "
"authentication enabled:"
msgstr "加上 Postgres 和前端，并重建后端、打开鉴权："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:155
msgid ""
"This is an in-place transition, not a second deployment. The bundled "
"provider keeps running in the existing project and network. Postgres is "
"added with an example-owned persistent volume, the backend is recreated "
"against it, and the frontend is added last."
msgstr ""
"这是在原有项目上原地升级，不是再部署一套。随附的 provider 继续在原来的项目和网络里运行。先加入 "
"Postgres，使用示例专属的持久卷；然后重建后端，连上这个数据库；最后加入前端。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:160
msgid ""
"Open <http://localhost:13001/signup> — or your own `FRONTEND_PORT` if you"
" overrode it — and complete the browser flow:"
msgstr ""
"打开 <http://localhost:13001/signup>（如果改过 "
"`FRONTEND_PORT`，就换成你的端口），在浏览器里完成下面的步骤："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:163
msgid ""
"Sign up with `admin@local.dev`, a username, and a password with at least "
"eight characters, uppercase, lowercase, and a number. Use a demo-only "
"password that you do not reuse elsewhere, then accept the terms."
msgstr ""
"用 `admin@local.dev` 注册，再填一个用户名和密码。密码至少八位，要包含大写字母、小写字母和数字。这个密码只在 demo "
"里用，不要和别处的密码重复。然后接受条款。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:166
msgid ""
"Select **Back to Login**, then sign in with the same email and password. "
"Email verification is disabled for this loopback-only example."
msgstr "点 **Back to Login**，再用同一个邮箱和密码登录。这个只跑在回环地址上的示例关闭了邮箱验证。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:168
msgid ""
"On the dashboard, create an API key, then reveal and copy it for the API "
"call below."
msgstr "在仪表盘上创建一个 API key，然后显示并复制它，下面的 API 调用要用。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:170
msgid ""
"Open **API Playground**, select `example-chat`, and send a message. The "
"reply is `RUNNABLE_EXAMPLE_OK`."
msgstr "打开 **API Playground**，选择 `example-chat`，发一条消息。回复是 `RUNNABLE_EXAMPLE_OK`。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:172
msgid ""
"Open **Admin Console**. This account is an admin because its email "
"matches the example's explicit `ADMIN_EMAILS` value in "
"`distributions/example/deploy/docker-compose.demo.yml`."
msgstr ""
"打开 **Admin Console**。这个账号是管理员，因为它的邮箱和示例在 `distributions/example/deploy"
"/docker-compose.demo.yml` 里显式设置的 `ADMIN_EMAILS` 一致。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:176
msgid ""
"The **Providers** and **Routing** tabs are where a provider, a key or a "
"model is added to a running gateway; [Runtime configuration from the "
"admin console](configuration.md#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-"
"console) walks through them."
msgstr ""
"**Providers** 和 **Routing** 两个标签页就是给运行中的网关添加 provider、key "
"或模型的地方；[从管理控制台做运行时配置](configuration.md#runtime-configuration-from-the-"
"admin-console)会逐个讲。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:181
msgid ""
"The UI and API share one origin. Requests to `/v1`, `/auth`, `/user`, and"
" `/admin` on port `13001` are rewritten by the frontend to the backend "
"inside the Compose network (`apps/frontend/next.config.js`)."
msgstr ""
"UI 和 API 共用一个 origin。发往 `13001` 端口上 `/v1`、`/auth`、`/user`、`/admin` "
"的请求，由前端重写到 Compose 网络内部的后端（`apps/frontend/next.config.js`）。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:185
msgid "Use the copied key for a normal authenticated request through that origin:"
msgstr "用刚复制的 key，通过这个 origin 发一次正常的带鉴权请求："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:196
msgid ""
"Now return to the dashboard's **Recent Requests** section. The request "
"you just sent appears there after a moment. Playground messages are not "
"recorded in this history, so use an API request like this one when you "
"check it."
msgstr ""
"现在回到仪表盘的 **Recent Requests** 区块。刚才发的请求稍等一会儿就会出现在那里。Playground "
"里发的消息不会记进这份历史，所以检查时要用像这样的 API 请求。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:200
msgid ""
"The dashboard may also render cards for optional services such as Agents "
"or pgAdmin. They are not part of this example and their routes are "
"unavailable unless you deploy those services separately."
msgstr "仪表盘上还可能出现 Agents、pgAdmin 这类可选服务的卡片。它们不属于本示例，除非你另外部署这些服务，否则对应的页面都打不开。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:204
msgid ""
"Use the password you chose above to run the deterministic full-stack "
"check:"
msgstr "用上面选的密码运行全栈自动检查："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:215
msgid ""
"The check signs in to the account (creating it if you skipped the browser"
" steps), reuses or creates an API key, and sends normal and streaming "
"requests through the console's address. It also exercises the Playground "
"and the Admin API, confirms that a second, non-admin user gets `403` from"
" the Admin API, and checks the request history. Finally it recreates the "
"backend and confirms that the account, its sign-in session and the API "
"key still work. It prints no secrets and does not reset the database."
msgstr ""
"这个检查会登录账号（如果你跳过了浏览器里的步骤，就先创建它），复用或新建一个 API "
"key，并通过控制台的地址发送普通请求和流式请求。它还会跑一遍 Playground 和 Admin API，确认第二个非管理员用户调用 "
"Admin API 时拿到 `403`，并核对请求历史。最后它会重建后端，确认账号、它的登录会话和 API key "
"都仍然可用。它不会打印任何密钥，也不会重置数据库。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:223
msgid "Stage 3: replace the fake provider with local inference"
msgstr "阶段 3：把假 provider 换成本地推理"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:225
msgid ""
"Start an OpenAI-compatible vLLM, SGLang, Ollama, or similar server on the"
" host. It must listen on a Docker-reachable address such as "
"`0.0.0.0:8000`; a server bound only to host `127.0.0.1` is not reachable "
"from the backend container. Binding to `0.0.0.0` can expose an "
"unauthenticated model server to your LAN, so restrict the port with a "
"host firewall or bind a Docker-reachable private interface instead when "
"your runtime supports it."
msgstr ""
"在主机上启动一个 OpenAI 兼容的 vLLM、SGLang、Ollama 或同类服务器。它必须监听一个 Docker 能访问到的地址，例如 "
"`0.0.0.0:8000`；只绑定在主机 `127.0.0.1` 上的服务器，后端容器访问不到。绑定 `0.0.0.0` "
"可能把一个无鉴权的模型服务器暴露到局域网，因此要用主机防火墙限制该端口；如果运行时支持，也可以改为绑定一个 Docker 能访问的内网接口。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:232
msgid "Then point the same public model at that server:"
msgstr "然后把同一个对外模型指向那台服务器："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:241
msgid ""
"`make demo` recreates the backend so the new upstream settings take "
"effect, while preserving the account, API key, frontend, and Postgres "
"volume. Clients and the Playground still request `example-chat`; only the"
" route behind it has changed. `curl -s localhost:18080/routing` now "
"reports the new `base_url` (substitute your own `BACKEND_PORT` here too "
"if you overrode it)."
msgstr ""
"`make demo` 会重建后端，让新的上游设置生效，同时保留账号、API key、前端和 Postgres 卷。客户端和 Playground"
" 请求的仍然是 `example-chat`，变的只是它背后那条路由。现在 `curl -s localhost:18080/routing` "
"会显示新的 `base_url`（如果改过 `BACKEND_PORT`，这里也要换成你的端口）。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:247
msgid ""
"`EXAMPLE_UPSTREAM_API_KEY` is the credential the gateway presents to that"
" provider. It is not the `HYBRIDINFERENCE_API_KEY` minted in Stage 2, "
"which is the client credential presented to the gateway."
msgstr ""
"`EXAMPLE_UPSTREAM_API_KEY` 是网关向那个 provider 出示的凭据。它不是阶段 2 里签发的 "
"`HYBRIDINFERENCE_API_KEY`——后者是客户端向网关出示的凭据。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:251
msgid ""
"Use the Playground or the authenticated `curl` from Stage 2 to test the "
"real model. Do not run either bundled smoke check against it: both expect"
" the fake provider's fixed reply, which a real model will not produce."
msgstr ""
"用 Playground 或阶段 2 里那条带鉴权的 `curl` 测试真实模型。随附的两个 smoke 检查都不要拿来测它：它们都要求拿到假 "
"provider 的固定回复，而真实模型不会给出这个回复。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:255
msgid "What the example contains"
msgstr "示例里有什么"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:257
msgid ""
"The example is one [distribution](glossary.md#deployments) — a directory "
"of deployment files that the gateway reads instead of anything built into"
" the source:"
msgstr "这个示例就是一个[发行版](glossary.md#deployments)——一个部署文件目录，网关读的是这里的文件，而不是源码里内置的任何东西："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:278
msgid ""
"`distribution.yaml` describes the Stage 1 capability with public signup "
"off. `distribution.demo.yaml` describes the same distribution after auth "
"and the frontend are enabled. Both reuse the same model and routing "
"files; they do not duplicate a registry."
msgstr ""
"`distribution.yaml` 描述阶段 1 的功能，公开注册是关闭的。`distribution.demo.yaml` "
"描述同一个发行版在打开鉴权和前端之后的样子。两者用的是同一套模型和路由配置文件，不会再复制一份注册表。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:283
msgid ""
"The two Compose files follow the same progression. The first adds the "
"fake provider and starts the backend alone. The second adds the database "
"and console settings and a database volume of the example's own. Nothing "
"in the example touches the `hybridinference_postgres_data` volume a real "
"deployment uses."
msgstr ""
"两个 Compose 文件也是按同样的顺序递进的。第一个加入假 "
"provider，只启动后端。第二个加入数据库和控制台的设置，以及一个示例自己专用的数据库卷。示例里的任何东西都不会碰真实部署用的 "
"`hybridinference_postgres_data` 卷。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:289
msgid ""
"The `EXAMPLE_OVERLAY` file marks the directory as an example, so a plain "
"`make up` never picks it by accident; you select it with "
"`DISTRIBUTION=example`. It has nothing to do with which stage you are in."
msgstr ""
"`EXAMPLE_OVERLAY` 文件把这个目录标记为示例，所以不指定发行版的 `make up` 永远不会误选它；要用它，得传 "
"`DISTRIBUTION=example`。它跟你处在哪个阶段无关。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:293
msgid "Where to go next"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:295
msgid ""
"To build your own deployment, copy this directory, delete "
"`EXAMPLE_OVERLAY` and the fake provider, replace every local-only name "
"and secret, and see [Distribution customization](distribution-"
"customization.md) for what else a distribution can set."
msgstr ""
"要搭建自己的部署，就把这个目录复制一份，删掉 `EXAMPLE_OVERLAY` 和假 "
"provider，把所有只在本地用的名字和密钥都换掉；发行版还能设置什么，见[发行版定制](distribution-"
"customization.md)。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:299
msgid ""
"[Configuration](configuration.md) — settings, environment variables, and "
"how a deployment supplies its own files."
msgstr "[配置](configuration.md)——设置项、环境变量，以及部署怎样提供自己的文件。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:301
msgid ""
"[Adding a New Model](adding-models.md) — the model registry entry and its"
" `route:` list."
msgstr "[添加新模型](adding-models.md)——模型注册表条目及其 `route:` 列表。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:303
msgid ""
"[Routing](routing.md) — weighted selection, fallback, circuit breaking, "
"session affinity, and how to add your own routing strategy."
msgstr "[路由](routing.md)——加权选择、回退、熔断、会话亲和，以及如何加入自己的路由策略。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:305
msgid ""
"[Installation](installation.md) — running the gateway from a source "
"checkout against real providers."
msgstr "[安装](installation.md)——从源码检出运行网关，对接真实 provider。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:308
msgid "Stop, resume, and reset"
msgstr "停止、恢复与重置"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:310
msgid ""
"After Stage 2 or Stage 3, stop all four services while keeping the "
"account, API key, and request history:"
msgstr "在阶段 2 或阶段 3 之后，停掉全部四个服务，同时保留账号、API key 和请求历史："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:317
msgid ""
"Resume Stage 2 with `make demo DISTRIBUTION=example`. To resume Stage 3, "
"first restore the three `EXAMPLE_UPSTREAM_*` exports from that stage, "
"then run the same command; those shell overrides are not stored in the "
"database. To stop the stack and delete this example project's data:"
msgstr ""
"用 `make demo DISTRIBUTION=example` 恢复阶段 2。要恢复阶段 3，先重新 export 那个阶段的三个 "
"`EXAMPLE_UPSTREAM_*` 变量，再运行同一条命令；这些在 shell "
"里设的覆盖值不会存进数据库。要停掉整套服务并删除这个示例项目的数据："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:326
msgid ""
"`demo-reset` is destructive for the example data, but it cannot delete "
"the production database volume. If you intentionally stop after Stage 1 "
"instead, use `make down DISTRIBUTION=example`."
msgstr ""
"`demo-reset` 会删掉示例数据，但删不到生产数据库卷。如果你本来就打算在阶段 1 之后停下，用 `make down "
"DISTRIBUTION=example`。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:330
msgid ""
"Once Stage 2 has started, do not use plain `make up DISTRIBUTION=example`"
" to try to downgrade the running project: that command only applies the "
"Stage 1 Compose inputs and can leave the full-stack services in a mixed "
"state. Use `make demo-reset DISTRIBUTION=example`, then begin again at "
"Stage 1."
msgstr ""
"阶段 2 启动之后，不要用单独的 `make up DISTRIBUTION=example` 把正在运行的项目退回阶段 1：这条命令只会应用阶段"
" 1 的 Compose 配置，可能让全栈服务处于新旧混杂的状态。应该运行 `make demo-reset "
"DISTRIBUTION=example`，再从阶段 1 重新开始。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:335
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:337
msgid "Port already in use"
msgstr "端口已被占用"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:339
msgid "Repeat the same overrides on each command in the linear journey:"
msgstr "按顺序执行的每一条命令，都要带上同样的覆盖设置："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:355
msgid ""
"Then use backend port `28080` in Stage 1 and frontend port `23001` in "
"Stages 2 and 3. The links the site generates follow the same ports: from "
"Stage 2 on, `docker-compose.demo.yml` builds `SITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL`, "
"`BASE_URL` and `FRONTEND_URL` from `FRONTEND_PORT`. Keep the same three "
"ports on every later `make demo` or `make demo-smoke`, including the "
"Stage 3 command, because both commands can recreate containers."
msgstr ""
"之后在阶段 1 用后端端口 `28080`，在阶段 2 和阶段 3 用前端端口 `23001`。站点生成的链接也跟着这些端口走：从阶段 2 起"
"，`docker-compose.demo.yml` 会用 `FRONTEND_PORT` 拼出 "
"`SITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL`、`BASE_URL` 和 `FRONTEND_URL`。后面每一次 `make demo` 或 "
"`make demo-smoke`（包括阶段 3 的那条命令）都要沿用这三个端口，因为这两条命令都可能重建容器。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:362
msgid "Cannot connect to the Docker daemon"
msgstr "无法连接 Docker daemon"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:364
msgid ""
"Start Docker Desktop or Colima first. `docker info` must print a server "
"section before `make up` can work."
msgstr "先启动 Docker Desktop 或 Colima。`docker info` 必须能打印出 server 段，`make up` 才能工作。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:367
msgid "Empty `/v1/models` and `routes_configured: 0`"
msgstr "`/v1/models` 为空，且 `routes_configured: 0`"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:369
msgid ""
"The backend could not read the example's config. The most common cause on"
" macOS is a checkout outside Docker's shared file paths: the "
"`distributions/` bind mount then resolves to an empty directory inside "
"the VM, the manifest at `/app/distributions/example/distribution.yaml` is"
" missing, and `make logs s=backend DISTRIBUTION=example` says so "
"explicitly. Move the checkout under a shared path (or add yours in Docker"
" Desktop's *File sharing* settings) and run `make up "
"DISTRIBUTION=example` again."
msgstr ""
"后端读不到示例的配置。在 macOS 上，最常见的原因是代码目录不在 Docker 的共享路径里：这时 `distributions/` 这个 "
"bind mount 在虚拟机里对应的是一个空目录，`/app/distributions/example/distribution.yaml` "
"这份 manifest 就不存在，`make logs s=backend DISTRIBUTION=example` "
"会明确报出这一点。把代码目录移到共享路径下（或者在 Docker Desktop 的 *File sharing* "
"设置里加上你的路径），再运行一次 `make up DISTRIBUTION=example`。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:377
msgid "`make up` chose another distribution"
msgstr "`make up` 选中了别的发行版"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:379
msgid ""
"Always pass `DISTRIBUTION=example` while following this tutorial. Without"
" it, `make up` uses a real distribution if your checkout has one, and "
"never the example."
msgstr ""
"跟着本教程操作时，每次都要传 `DISTRIBUTION=example`。不传的话，只要你的仓库里有真实的发行版，`make up` "
"就会用它，而且永远不会选这个示例。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:383
msgid "Start over after a partial run"
msgstr "跑到一半后重新开始"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:385
msgid ""
"Use `make demo-reset DISTRIBUTION=example`, then begin again at Stage 1. "
"Do not delete Docker volumes by broad name or prune unrelated projects."
msgstr ""
"用 `make demo-reset DISTRIBUTION=example`，然后从阶段 1 重新开始。不要按名字模糊匹配去删 Docker "
"卷，也不要 prune 无关的项目。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:388
msgid "Inspect a failed service"
msgstr "查看出问题的服务"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:390
msgid ""
"`make logs DISTRIBUTION=example` sees the running services in the shared "
"Compose project at every stage. To inspect one service after Stage 2, "
"use:"
msgstr ""
"`make logs DISTRIBUTION=example` 在每个阶段都能看到共享 Compose 项目里正在运行的服务。阶段 2 "
"之后要单看某一个服务，用："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:397
msgid ""
"Replace `backend` with `frontend`, `postgres`, or `example-provider` as "
"needed."
msgstr "按需要把 `backend` 换成 `frontend`、`postgres` 或 `example-provider`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You do not choose between a "
#~ "router-only product and a full-stack"
#~ " product. The small router is the "
#~ "first checkpoint on one path, so "
#~ "you see a successful request before "
#~ "adding the parts that have more "
#~ "ways to fail."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "不需要在「纯路由」和「全栈」两种产品之间做选择。小 router "
#~ "只是同一条路径上的第一个检查点：先看到一次成功的请求，再去添加那些失败方式更多的部件。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "That fixed reply proves the request "
#~ "passed through HybridInference routing to "
#~ "the bundled upstream. Clients address "
#~ "`example-chat`; the route maps it to"
#~ " the upstream's own model id."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这个固定回复证明请求确实经过 HybridInference 的路由到达了随附的上游。客户端寻址的是 "
#~ "`example-chat`；路由把它映射到上游自己的模型 id。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Every `chat.completion.chunk` frame in one "
#~ "response repeats one completion id, and"
